Oh, look, what a great little bib for the baby.

36
00:01:56,930 --> 00:01:58,230
This will definitely come in handy.

37
00:01:59,010 --> 00:02:01,290
Oh, wow, you also got me a stroller.

38
00:02:01,930 --> 00:02:02,710
That's so great.

39
00:02:03,110 --> 00:02:03,670
Thank you.

40
00:02:04,210 --> 00:02:06,090
This next one is from Betty.

41
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:09,000
A high chair and a car seat.

42
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,870
Wow, Betty, thank you so much.

43
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,270
I really appreciate it.

44
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:14,130
One more from Carla.

45
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,240
A playpen and crib.

46
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,280
Thanks, Carla.

47
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,140
This is just what I needed.

48
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,460
