00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,750
I think my water just broke.

199
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:05,910
Get me to a hospital.

200
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:18,400
All right, so talking about baby things and baby showers.

201
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:20,000
It's a very interesting tradition.

202
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:24,000
I understand that in other countries they don't really celebrate baby showers like this.

203
00:10:24,260 --> 00:10:24,400
Really?

204
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:28,060
Yeah, or that if they do, they do it in different ways.

205
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:35,400
I know for example that sometimes in Latin American countries, they usually do it after the baby's born.

206
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:37,880
Oh, so like a congratulations shower.

207
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:38,360
Exactly.

208
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:44,560
And then obviously you know if the baby was a boy or a girl, so then you get them like pink things or blue things.

209
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,680
So it's a little bit more.

210
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,100
That's what's really funny about these.

211
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:53,670
People often want to have the surprise of not knowing if the baby will be a boy or a girl.

212
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:58,370
So when they have the baby shower, they say, oh, I don't know what the gender is.

213
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:02,910
And so you end up buying all of these yellow things because yellow is neutral.

214
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:04,840
It's good for boys and girls.

215
00:11:04,970 --> 00:11:07,050
I don't know how many yellow gifts I've got.

216
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:18,350
I think it's a very interesting thing because for example, I know that in China, I think you can't ask the doctor for the gender of the baby before it's born, right?

217
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:22,400
I think that's a way to, I'm not sure if it's a rule or not, but it sounds right.

218
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:25,520
I mean, it's a way to protect female babies.

219
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:28,320
I think it would be always great to just have it be a surprise.

220
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:29,880
You never know.

221
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:32,160
Yeah, just like, oh, you know, whatever comes out.

222
00:11:32,300 --> 00:11:34,160
Can you imagine not knowing and then you have twins?

223
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:40,340
That would be great for me, I think, if I had like a boy and a girl, bam, all at once.

224
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,100
All at once, never have to worry about it again.

225
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:45,000
Exactly, and then you have the best of both worlds, right?

226
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:45,140
